     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear All , <br><br><div>I&#39;m writing to ask for your help with some doubts. I&#39;m currently trying to use the segment optimizer but I can&#39;t understand how to enter the parameters into the x-vector for the genetic algorithm to work. <br></div><div><br></div><div>using the data from the example available at <a href=\"https://segoptim.bitbucket.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://segoptim.bitbucket.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246057316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1dGiH4TqEmXuPJC4FYPzWT\">https://segoptim.bitbucket.io</a> I&#39;m trying this: <br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">segmObj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> segmentation_RSGISLib_Shep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">21</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        inputRstPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputSegFeat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        outputSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#NumClust=10, </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#MinSize=100, </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#SpectralThresh=1000, </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        pythonPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pyPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        verbose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></div></code></div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>Which gives me the same result as if I tried it this way:<br><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:#000\">           </span><span style=\"color:#660\"></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> segmObj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> segmentation_RSGISLib_Shep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputRstPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputSegFeat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        outputSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NumClust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">MinSize</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">21</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">SpectralThresh</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        pythonPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pyPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#000\">        verbose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></div></div></code></div><br><br><br>Additionally I can&#39;t understand how to enter the optimal segmentation parameters in the segmObj list. <br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">I would greatly appreciate if you can help me with these questions beforehand, thank you.</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">best wishes <br>Alex <br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"> <br></div></div></div>"
